# oracle: pair_style table spline 500 with a table that has FPRIME end slopes (w10table_lj_fp50.table, LJ 12-6 in RSQ, outer distance 2.5) used with a pair cutoff of 2.0 below the outer table distance, so the outer force-spline end slope is the secant estimate (src/pair_table.cpp compute_table, SPLINE branch, "tb->cut == tb->rfile[tb->ninput - 1]" test); 108 atoms, run 0
# guard: passes on main (the FPRIME inner end and the cutoff-below-outer-table branch agree with native); measured max error per atom relative to max(1,|value|): per-atom 1.1e-14 (atom 12 fx), thermo 1.8e-15. native: b332f28 (/home/roy/.local/bin/lmp)
# oracle-inputs: w10table_lj_fp50.table
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
dimension       3
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
group           odd id 1:108:2
set             group odd type 2
mass            * 1.0
variable        dx atom 0.04*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.04*cos(0.9*y-1.1*z)
variable        dz atom 0.04*sin(1.7*z+0.5*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
variable        vx atom 0.8*sin(0.9*x+0.4*z)
variable        vy atom 0.8*cos(0.6*y+0.8*x)
variable        vz atom 0.8*sin(0.7*z-0.3*y)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz units box
pair_style      table spline 500
pair_coeff      1 1 w10table_lj_fp50.table LJ11 2.0
pair_coeff      2 2 w10table_lj_fp50.table LJ11 2.0
pair_coeff      1 2 w10table_lj_fp50.table LJ11 2.0
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             0
